# The boards on this bench: one `name  MAC` pair per line.
#
# Copy to `devices.list` (gitignored) and put your own in. Every script that can
# write to a device looks the board up here first, because the numbering in
# /dev/ttyACM<n> shuffles between plug-ins and this repository has already come
# within one guard of erasing a different board's flash.
#
# The MAC is on the by-id path the board enumerates as:
#
#     ls /dev/serial/by-id/
#     usb-Espressif_USB_JTAG_serial_debug_unit_AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF-if00
#                                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
#
# The first entry is the default. Name others to keep them straight -- and to
# make it obvious when a port resolves to one of them by mistake.

lightning   AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF
# panel     11:22:33:44:55:66
